{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559780/extras/39515cf7e10c6efa96aab9fa3962fc2d.poster.avif?t=1739288607\" width=600 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559780/extras/39515cf7e10c6efa96aab9fa3962fc2d.webm?t=1739288607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559780/extras/39515cf7e10c6efa96aab9fa3962fc2d.mp4?t=1739288607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\ud83d\udceb <strong>Letter Bunny is a cozy adventure game about mail</strong> \ud83d\udceb<br>You play as Anne, a small bunny tasked with delivering mail on a big island.<br>Discover the story of the many inhabitants, get to know them through the many letters, and help them out in their daily shenanigans.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559780/extras/3065972b07c32daeba683864b53e6bc2.avif?t=1739288607\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br>\ud83d\udc26<strong>The local postbirds are understaffed!</strong> \ud83d\udc26<br>After a big storm hit the island many letters and packages have been lost. Help deliver the numerous parcels to the right recipient while exploring the island and making new friends. <br><br>What are you waiting for? Wear the uniform, grab the backpack and you're off on delivery!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559780/extras/95705140f5f955416a5dc746a20371e5.poster.avif?t=1739288607\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559780/extras/95705140f5f955416a5dc746a20371e5.webm?t=1739288607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559780/extras/95705140f5f955416a5dc746a20371e5.mp4?t=1739288607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u2709\ufe0f <strong>Get a glimpse into the life of the many residents with every letter</strong> \u2709\ufe0f <br>Help them out through their daily troubles. Give them a hand or lend them an ear and they might become your friends. Take your time talking with everyone, everyone has something to say or a story to share!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559780/extras/6b264b1e15ef13dcd53c073668bbcf8b.avif?t=1739288607\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br>\ud83d\udc30<strong>Hop into a new adventure!</strong>\ud83d\udc30<br>There is a whole island to explore and many letters to be delivered. Find clever ways to get the job done<br>\ud83c\udf92 Use the different gadgets at your disposal to ease your journey!<br>\u2602\ufe0f Have fun gliding and sliding from one parcel to the next one. Don't forget to check for secrets while you get there!<br>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Never get lost with your trusty map! You'll always know where to go.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559780/extras/32bc12cde220b6aa325fba8b15914cfe.poster.avif?t=1739288607\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559780/extras/32bc12cde220b6aa325fba8b15914cfe.webm?t=1739288607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559780/extras/32bc12cde220b6aa325fba8b15914cfe.mp4?t=1739288607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559780/extras/1dc849df3950a223b0c48c725f9f6797.avif?t=1739288607\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br>\u2728<strong>Get distracted by the many things to do! </strong>\u2728<br>\ud83d\udc1f Want to go fishing? No problem! Grab your trusty fishing pole and give a high-five to every local fish!<br>\ud83d\udc1e Do you prefer bug catching? We've got you covered! Do a little dance to befriend the colorful critters!<br>\ud83d\udce6 Someone lost a package? Better find who's the recipient! It might be something important!<br>\ud83d\udef7 Want to prove that you're the fastest sled racer on the island? Don't worry, you'll find the right challenge for you!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559780/extras/61f17ff832eb962c455ec4a9f32b8198.poster.avif?t=1739288607\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559780/extras/61f17ff832eb962c455ec4a9f32b8198.webm?t=1739288607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559780/extras/61f17ff832eb962c455ec4a9f32b8198.mp4?t=1739288607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>If you've read all the way here... you're awesome! \ud83d\ude09","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2559780?t=1739288607","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559780/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1739288607","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559780/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739288607","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559780/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739288607","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":