lay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559780/extras/95705140f5f955416a5dc746a20371e5.poster.avif?t=1739288607\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559780/extras/95705140f5f955416a5dc746a20371e5.webm?t=1739288607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559780/extras/95705140f5f955416a5dc746a20371e5.mp4?t=1739288607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u2709\ufe0f <strong>Get a glimpse into the life of the many residents with every letter</strong> \u2709\ufe0f <br>Help them out through their daily troubles. Give them a hand or lend them an ear and they might become your friends. Take your time talking with everyone, everyone has something to say or a story to share!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559780/extras/6b264b1e15ef13dcd53c073668bbcf8b.avif?t=1739288607\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br>\ud83d\udc30<strong>Hop into a new adventure!</strong>\ud83d\udc30<br>There is a whole island to explore and many letters to be delivered. Find clever ways to get the job done<br>\ud83c\udf92 Use the different gadgets at your disposal to ease your journey!<br>\u2602\ufe0f Have fun gliding and sliding from one parcel to the next one. Don't forget to check for secrets while you get there!<br>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Never get lost with your trusty map! You'll always know where to go.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559780/extras/32bc12cde220b6aa325fba8b15914cfe.poster.avif?t=1739288607\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559780/extras/32bc12cde220b6aa325fba8b15914cfe.webm